OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy and dry to start
OL,6,Fthe day. Sunny spells at times but
OL,7,Fwith isolated showers developing
OL,8,Fthrough the late morning onwards.
OL,9,FWinds freshening through the afternoon
OL,10,Fbut feeling pleasant in the sun.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny lingering showers ease to
OL,13,Fleave a dry, partly cloudy evening.
OL,14,FRemaining mostly cloudy with clear
OL,15,Fspells overnight and dry for most
OL,16,Fareas. Feeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
