OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA partly cloudy day with good
OL,6,Fsunny spells. Isolated showers may
OL,7,Fdevelop during the afternoon, but many
OL,8,Fareas remain dry. Feeling cooler in
OL,9,Ffresh winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FPatchy
OL,12,Frain across the area for a time on
OL,13,FWednesday but clearing to a fine and
OL,14,Fdry Thursday. More unsettled on Friday
OL,15,Fwith rain and then showers. Fresh
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
